#ASSERT `Do Parts X and XI apply to my claim` TRUE `no other scheme` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Do Parts X and XI apply to my claim` TRUE `no other scheme` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Not in the s 45(1) list: WIRC Act Part 7, victims of crime assistance (finding 3).
#ASSERT `Do Parts X and XI apply to my claim` TRUE `Workplace Injury Rehabilitation and Compensation Act 2013 Part 7` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Do Parts X and XI apply to my claim` TRUE `Victims of Crime Assistance Act 1996` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE

