§§ `Mental harm (ss 72-75)`

#ASSERT `Could I have been owed a duty not to be caused pure mental harm` TRUE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `Could I have been owed a duty not to be caused pure mental harm` FALSE TRUE EQUALS TRUE
