      `in care` IS A BOOLEAN, `unrelated` IS A BOOLEAN, `precautions` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 91 case` `the day` `age` `kind` `role` `in care` `unrelated` `precautions` MEANS
    `Is the organisation presumed to have breached its duty to prevent my abuse` `the day` `age` `kind` FALSE TRUE TRUE `capable in law of being sued` `role` FALSE FALSE `in care` `unrelated` `precautions`

